------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no third-party source. Everything below is fetched or
copied into an ephemeral build context by scripts/stage-context.sh and lands in
the built image; each keeps its own license.

Every license below was READ FROM THE ARTIFACT ITSELF (the installed file in
the image, or the LICENSE inside the .vsix) on 2026-07-26 — not from memory and
not from a marketplace listing. Re-verify when a pin moves.

